# Home / stills

Runbook: `src/assets/stills/README.md`.

## Home posters (`CreativeTextRow`)

1. Add image under `src/assets/stills/` (jpg/png/webp).
2. Import + add flow image in `src/features/home/creativeFlow.ts` (id, column, top, widthRatio, float, aspectRatio, src, alt).
3. Layout helpers: `src/features/home/creativeTextLayout.ts`. Prefer `object-contain` (no crop).
4. Center silhouette: `src/assets/creative-intelligence.svg` (wired via `creativeFlow.shapeSrc`).
5. Page shell only: `src/pages/Home.tsx` — don’t dump long flow copy back into the page.

Images are draggable wrap obstacles; dragging rearranges wrap path only.

## Writing figures

Same `stills/` folder. In article JSON use filename-only `"src"`. Resolved by `writingArticles.ts` glob — no Home import required.

## Do / don't

- ✅ Home posters need explicit import in `creativeFlow.ts`
- ❌ Don’t use old paths `home-assets/` or put posters only in `Home.tsx`
